<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch shares closed for holiday, reopen Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Dutch shares closed for holiday, reopen Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch stock market is closed on Monday for Whitsun holiday and will reopen at 0730 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shares closed lower on Friday ahead of the holiday, with the AEX index of leading shares down 0.72 points to 794.30.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000, fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
